{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creej's Corruption\u00a0</i>is a <u><strong>Combat Based First-Person Action RPG</strong></u> set in a pre-apocalyptic Suburban Town. When reuniting with your childhood friend, an ominous building in the distance suddenly collapses causing a massive chain of events. Your friend has been taken. You are the only one who can save him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/a5e355b9e476de63b7f4eaecfe72cf8a.poster.avif?t=1763182382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/a5e355b9e476de63b7f4eaecfe72cf8a.webm?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/a5e355b9e476de63b7f4eaecfe72cf8a.mp4?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game features a handcrafted <strong>First-Person Combat system</strong> intended to feel extremely impactful and satisfying. The protagonist, Jeremy, is an ordinary teenager without any  fighting experience. <u><strong>Fights will be brutal and challenging, requiring perfect dodging or parrying in order to survive</strong></u><strong>.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/34ed228889dd9476dbe68f94fd9b2be4.poster.avif?t=1763182382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/34ed228889dd9476dbe68f94fd9b2be4.webm?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/34ed228889dd9476dbe68f94fd9b2be4.mp4?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>Explore the expansive open world featuring a day night cycle, a weather cycle, multiple biomes, towns, neighborhoods, and enemies who all have their own unique abilities and features. <strong>Embark on a 20+ hour main story with lots of cutscenes, side content, locations, and dangers to find your missing friend and learn the truth!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.poster.avif?t=1763182382\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.webm?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.mp4?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420700?t=1763182382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/17464e4462d091455f3233a93dbb3ee265d0d255/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763182382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/facb2e6c3e69019b0867a2ccf0cc563a3e1bc6fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763182382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/facb2e6c3e69019b0867a2ccf0cc563a3e1bc6fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763182382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creej's Corruption\u00a0</i>is a <u><strong>Combat Based First-Person Action RPG</strong></u> set in a pre-apocalyptic Suburban Town. When reuniting with your childhood friend, an ominous building in the distance suddenly collapses causing a massive chain of events. Your friend has been taken. You are the only one who can save him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/a5e355b9e476de63b7f4eaecfe72cf8a.poster.avif?t=1763182382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/a5e355b9e476de63b7f4eaecfe72cf8a.webm?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/a5e355b9e476de63b7f4eaecfe72cf8a.mp4?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game features a handcrafted <strong>First-Person Combat system</strong> intended to feel extremely impactful and satisfying. The protagonist, Jeremy, is an ordinary teenager without any  fighting experience. <u><strong>Fights will be brutal and challenging, requiring perfect dodging or parrying in order to survive</strong></u><strong>.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/34ed228889dd9476dbe68f94fd9b2be4.poster.avif?t=1763182382\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/34ed228889dd9476dbe68f94fd9b2be4.webm?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/34ed228889dd9476dbe68f94fd9b2be4.mp4?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>Explore the expansive open world featuring a day night cycle, a weather cycle, multiple biomes, towns, neighborhoods, and enemies who all have their own unique abilities and features. <strong>Embark on a 20+ hour main story with lots of cutscenes, side content, locations, and dangers to find your missing friend and learn the truth!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.poster.avif?t=1763182382\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.webm?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.mp4?t=1763182382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["AGW","The Creej Crew"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/d552151c420c1418b5cc4efe3fcb5ea91562dc21/header.jpg?t=1763182382","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS (Latest Version)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Steam Deck<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 800p Medium Settings | 40Fps</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS (Latest Version)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 12600K | Ryzen 5 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3070 Ti | RX 7800 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1440p Hig